  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Low-top retro basketball silhouette reimagined for everyday lifestyle wear\nCrisp leather upper with perforations on the toe box for ventilation\nDurable leather overlays with a slight sheen for classic '80s basketball style\nSignature Swoosh branding for heritage vibes\nSecure lace closure for a locked-in fit\nPadded tongue and collar add an old-school look and extra comfort\nFoam midsole offers lightweight, responsive cushioning\nRubber outsole with a pivot-circle pattern for durability, grip and heritage style\nThe Nike Dunk Low SP is imported.\nThe Men's Nike Dunk Low SP Casual Shoes turn back the clock and restore the feeling of previous generations of an all-time silhouette. Back in its original form, this low-profile icon returns to its roots by bringing back the glossy leather overlays, ultra-thick padded tongue and collar, and unapologetically bold colorways that nod to its collegiate hoops origins, remixed for everyday style that transcends the basketball court.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Dunk Low SP Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Varsity Maize/Pine Green/White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3394730</td></tr><tr><td styl